{{!
    @template core/email_html

    Override of the core wrapper of every HTML e-mail (lib/templates/email_html.mustache,
    rendered by email_to_user()). The layout lives in local_emaillayout so that both
    themes (ivana and moove, kept for rollback) share it and core stays untouched.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "sitefullname": "Ivana Academy",
        "sitewwwroot": "https://ivana.academy",
        "subject": "Subject",
        "body": "<p>Email body</p>"
    }
}}
{{> local_emaillayout/email_html}}
